Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.12,1:14:39.71,chs&eng,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看的我都恶心死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. I'm going into a diabetic coma just looking at it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.87,1:14:42.63,chs&eng,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我可没话说了 以前不是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, what can I say, ladies? It looked good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.84,1:14:48.05,chs&eng,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喝起来真是难以下咽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but it tastes totally disgusting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.05,1:14:55.30,chs&eng,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们就是救火英雄吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say, you're the guy who stopped that mall fire, aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.35,1:14:58.68,chs&eng,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可真是救了不少人啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You saved a lot of lives, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.81,1:15:02.02,chs&eng,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是碰巧在那个时间出现在那个地点而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was just at the right place at the right time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.19,1:15:06.15,chs&eng,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时候 就是得有这个运气才能"碰巧"上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mm-hm. Sometimes that's all it takes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.24,1:15:12.53,chs&eng,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 的确很奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, that was really weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.70,1:15:15.24,chs&eng,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 别搅了我的兴致\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, don't knock my fan base.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.41,1:15:16.91,chs&eng,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很喜欢你的包包\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love your bag, by the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.08,1:15:20.04,chs&eng,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 哦 谢了 我刚买的 - 是吗? 在哪买的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, thanks. I actually just got it. - Did you? Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.20,1:15:22.87,chs&eng,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 就在布维格旁边 新开的店\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. There's a place right next to Brevig's. It just opened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.08,1:15:25.38,chs&eng,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 布维格? - 是啊 就在购物中心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Brevig's? - Yeah, it's in that shopping center.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.54,1:15:28.59,chs&eng,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有个杂货店 还有个…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a grocery store and a card shop'and then there's a...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.75,1:15:31.17,chs&eng,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 看起来就像是个饰品店 - 哦 明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's like a little accessories store. - Oh, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.34,1:15:33.45,chs&eng,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超级可爱的 你要是想买…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's super cute. If you want one...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.45,1:15:35.55,chs&eng,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种包的话 他们只有2个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of these purses, they have it in plaid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.72,1:15:37.60,chs&eng,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 哈哈 这就是另一个吧? - 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ha, ha, is that the only other one? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.76,1:15:39.39,chs&eng,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们就制造了2个?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They only made two?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.78,1:15:55.78,chs&eng,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得呢 宝贝?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think, babe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.62,1:16:00.12,chs&eng,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 太空人醒醒 你回到地球了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, uh, space cadet, you wanna come back down to Earth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.25,1:16:06.63,chs&eng,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们什么都没改变 会是怎么个结局呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if we didn't change anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.08,1:16:08.31,chs&eng,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.31,1:16:09.55,chs&eng,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa, whoa, what are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.75,1:16:11.80,chs&eng,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们现在身处此地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if us being here right now...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.97,1:16:14.76,chs&eng,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是一开始就安排好了的呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...was the plan from the beginning?{\r}
